Package: vabaxos-desktop
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: vabaxos-accessibility, vabaxos-apps, vabaxos-apt, vabaxos-branding, vabaxos-help, vabaxos-kokoro-model, vabaxos-reader, vabaxos-screen-reader, vabaxos-settings, vabaxos-setup, vabaxos-sounds, vabaxos-start, vabaxos-update, vabaxos-voice, vabaxos-welcome
Description: all of VabaxOS
 This package installs nothing by itself: it depends on every VabaxOS
 package. Updates of VabaxOS bring new components through it: a new
 package of a later version (for example dictation in v0.2) becomes one
 more dependency, and the update installs it on systems installed with
 an earlier version (ADR-0020).
